window.products.push({"id":450095,"name":"Kardiel Roche Ottoman, Luxe Camel Standard Leather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51myyxqIJ7L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Kardiel offers the highest quality Le Corbusier LC3 Grande' reproduction on the market. We specialize in this series and understand fully the intricacies of the original design. From the supple Genuine leather to the plump generously filled and wrapped cushions, our full list of features means you don't have to settle for an inferior reproduction. You also don't have to pay more. With Kardiel's signature reproduction, you can have your own version of the Le Corbusier LC3 Grande series. Compare this reproduction anywhere for its highest standard of exacting detail. The accuracy of this LC3 Grande reproduction is second to none. Kardiel's Mid Century Classic Le Corbusier LC3 Style Ottoman Premium Reproduction Features: * 100% Genuine Leather * All joints are fully welded, grind, sealed and sanded * Adjustable leveling floor protecting foot-caps * Multi-density, compliant cushions wrapped in Dacron polyester batting * Ottoman Dimensions: Total height: 15\" x depth 22\" x width 28.5\" * #304 Stainless Steel lower frame with a 3 step hand mirror shine polish * External wrap around tubing made of #304 Stainless steel. No chipping or rusting * Reinforced bottom seat cushions for firm, long-lasting comfort * Hardwood box frame construction * 3 year limited manufacturer's warranty The Le Corbusier sofa set series was originally designed in 1928 for the Maison La Roche house in Paris. The design is the modernist response to the traditional club chair. The series comes in a smaller version referred to as the LC2 and a larger version known as the LC3 considered more appropriate for practical living purposes. Remarkably comfortable, Le Corbusier often referred to the pieces as \"cushion baskets.\" A striking feature of the LC3 is the externalized metal frame supporting the base, extending as the legs and running the entire length of the piece. Its not just the front of the LC3 that is attractive, the metal frame work means design detail from the sides and back allowing for easy placement even in the middle of a room. The Le Corbusier LC3 set is often used in a group of 2 chairs (1 seat version) and a single sofa or love (2 or 3 seat versions).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51myyxqIJ7L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B00PD73K6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PD73K6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PD73K6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
