window.products.push({"id":450180,"name":"Carry Me Owl Jaaliwork Soapstone Figurine for Living Room Bedroom Office Decoration Home Decor (4 x 2.5 x 4.5 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VdziL6XsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the single block of stone the mother Owl is intricately hand carved and reveals another intricately hand craved baby Owl inside. Artisans work painstakingly and tirelessly for few days to bring out perfectly carved peices. One wrong stroke and the openwork break and they need to discard the block and start all over again. The beauty of this detailed, intricate carving work is the reason for their immense popularity. Symbol of strength, power, stability and wisdom; this lucky Owl will certainly be owner’s pride. This is an all-natural soapstone sculpture hand-carved by traditional artisans in Agra -the city of the TajMahal- Symbol of eternal LOVE. Because this is a hand made product each piece will remain unique with natural variation in color and texture of stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VdziL6XsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carry Me","source_asin":"B083N2JLK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083N2JLK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083N2JLK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
