window.products.push({"id":450184,"name":"Wallmonkeys Dog Diver Wall Decal Peel and Stick Graphic (30 in H x 27 in W) WM117954","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLnW7m5HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Transform your room with freshly printed Wallmonkeys vinyl decals - Wallmonkeys decals can transform your lonely walls. We have the largest selection of wall stickers online with access to thousands of inspired prints. Find wall decals in the form of creative cartoons, vector illustrations and realistic photographs. Our premium material and superior inks guarantee you the highest quality vinyl wall decals money can buy. What makes Wallmonkeys wall decals the best money can buy? - Every decal is custom printed, one at a time, just for your wall, in Kensington, MD, USA. We use the highest quality printers, inks, and materials available. Simple to install. Remove our decals and reapply them in another location with ease. Wallmonkeys decals will never leave a mark, or damage your walls. Wallmonkeys has the largest selection of wall decals on Amazon. Decorating your home has never been easier with hundreds of thousands of images to choose from. Search our collection to find exactly what your heart desires. Available in a variety of sizes and prices, Wallmonkeys are always a perfect fit. To select the proper size of decals for your wall, measure the empty space you have to work with. Usually, selecting the item closest, but not larger than your wall area yields the best results. Have you measured your wall? Our Wall Stickers are printed on-demand, so PLEASE double check the size of the decal you are ordering prior to clicking the 'ADD TO CART' button. Our wall stickers typically print and ship within 1-2 business days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLnW7m5HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallmonkeys","source_asin":"B00P3W5V04","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P3W5V04","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P3W5V04","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450185,"name":"Sweese Porcelain Salad Bowls - 64 Ounce Large Soup Bowls - Serving Bowl for Cereal, Salad and Popcorn - Set of 1, Navy No. 133.103","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sy+qxT4FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Porcelain? Porcelain is made from kaolin clay. It is fired at temperatures in excess of 1,300 degrees Celsius and is fully vitrified, which makes it much sturdy than stoneware. Porcelain is generally white, gray or cream colored. It is smooth with a more delicate appearance. Porcelain ware is resistant to chip and stain, dishwasher and oven safe. Without containing any chemical, they are more healthy than other materials. Attractive Design ▶Versatile - Each bowl holds 64oz. Perfect for salads, popcorn, chilling or marinating. ▶Fluted shape design - Fluted dinnerware set is more stable, easy to hold HOT and COLD items in your hand. Search no more, you have come to the right place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sy+qxT4FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B094NH78RV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094NH78RV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094NH78RV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
