window.products.push({"id":450253,"name":"KIBAGA Farmhouse Welcome Sign For Seasonal Front Door Decoration - Double Sided 5 ft Tall Sign w/ 10 Elements Enhances Your Christmas and Fall Decor -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mLNX7TsuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KIBAGA outdoor welcome sign: great to welcome your guests in a charming style! The wooden front porch sign by KIBAGA has the perfect size (58.7x7.5x0.75”) for giving your family and friends a heartfelt welcome and also to decorate outside for seasons and holidays. Did you already see the beautiful and clever double-sided design? You can switch up your decoration by simply flipping the wooden sign around - one side says “welcome” and the other side “home sweet home” with gorgeous, durable lettering. Whether for summer decorations for your home or for other festive occasions - the wooden welcome sign is a great addition to any modern farmhouse decor. The sturdy hanging rope is not only fantastic for simple, versatile mounting, but even adds to the rustic decor vibes. Made from solid pine wood with lasting sealing, to help prevent rotting and warping, the decorative sign is your top-notch outdoor decor - premium design by KIBAGA. You will be over the moon by how many compliments you will receive for your welcome sign - and many more words of adoration for your eye-catching decor will follow when you showcase the seasonal elements. What a way to make the year more fun! 5 double-sided, round icons - 10 cute designs in total - making it a breeze to add some holiday and seasonal spirit to your front porch! There are already pre-drilled holes, so no drilling is necessary. Simply attach the two hooks included and you are all set to customize your welcome sign with creatively designed elements for: Valentine’s day, St. Patrick’s day, Spring, Easter, Summer, 4th of July, Fall, Halloween, Thanksgiving & Christmas. Choose from three different available colors to find the perfect match for your front porch: black, walnut-brown or white. Gift this adorable piece of wooden art to a special person: the welcome sign makes a wonderful gift for a housewarming, birthday or for other occasions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mLNX7TsuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIBAGA","source_asin":"B092M9ZLZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092M9ZLZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092M9ZLZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450254,"name":"Madison Park Palmer Duvet Set - Rustic Cabin Lodge Faux Suede Design, All Season Luxurious Comforter Cover Bed Set with Matching Shams, Purple King/Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MOdTC9y6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduce a sense of luxurious style with the Madison Park Palmer 6 Piece Faux Suede Duvet Cover Set. The faux suede duvet cover features a pieced design, in purple and silver hues, that creates a stunning and elegant allure. Two matching shams mimic the design of the duvet cover, while the square decorative pillows and the oblong decorative pillow with embroidered and pleated details add the finishing touches to the transitional duvet cover. With an incredibly soft hand feel, this faux suede duvet cover set brings lush style to your bedroom décor and is machine washable for easy care. A button closure helps secure a comforter insert within the duvet cover and inside ties in the corners help prevent it from shifting (insert is NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MOdTC9y6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B0888R984T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888R984T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888R984T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450255,"name":"Toadfish Non-Tipping Can Cooler for 12oz Cans - Suction Cup Cooler for Beer & Soda - Includes Slim Can Adapter - Stainless Steel Double-Wall Vacuum In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwrbBEAKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-Tipping for More Sipping: Ever felt the dread of reaching for a cold one just for it to accidentally tip over? Our non-tipping suction cup can coolers were crafted specifically to handle a bumpy ride on the golf cart or to stand up against the force of your dog's wagging tail. Powered by Smartgrip technology, it sticks to any smooth surface and is designed to stay put even on a rocky boat. Focus more on the adventure with this can cooler that's hard to tip but easy to lift. Double-Wall Vacuum Insulation Keeps Drinks Ice Cold: Unlike foam can holders our can coolers entail superior double-wall vacuum insulation that locks in cold, icy beverages. No matter how long you've been out on the dock, enjoy your refreshing drink from sun up to sun down. Plus, it halts condensation from beading on the outside of the cooler so you can have a firmer grip on your beverage. Relax on the dock as long as you want...It's no sweat! Crafted from Timeless Stainless Steel: Built from kitchen-grade stainless steel, your new can cooler is puncture & rust resistant. In short, it was made to LAST through perpetual wear and tear. Whether it's riding along with you through backwoods' terrain or a part of your weekend fishing essentials, rely on this beer cooler to keep up with your busy lifestyle. Accident-Proof & Adventure-Approved: To ensure your drinks stay put no matter what, we've added in a removable locking rubber gasket to keep your drink in place. Simply, place your 12oz can inside the can cooler and secure the rubber gasket on top, locking in your beverage. No spills, mess, or accidents, these can coolers can are perfect for the entire family: from the little ones to the adults. On A Mission to Put 'Em Back: We built Toadfish to help preserve our beautiful coastal waters. Due to an increase in population, toxic waste, and pollution, we're on a mission to help filter the water our resources thrive on by replenishing and regenerating oyster beds. Known as the \"friend of the coast,\" oysters filter toxins and provide a thriving nursery for hundreds of species. With every product sold, we're committed to planting a new oyster bed to enrich earth's most vital resource.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwrbBEAKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toadfish","source_asin":"B08LG1BT9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG1BT9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG1BT9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
