window.products.push({"id":450269,"name":"Lighted Christmas Snow Globes with Music, Battery Operated Glitter Lantern with USB, Christmas Musical Decorations for Gift, Christmas Santa Claus Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Ao+W3sRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8 Christmas Songs】Turn on the switch, as the lights flicker, eight Christmas songs will play on a loop. Leds will light up the snow globes collectibles, add magic to the christmas glitter lantern and you will enjoy a visual feast. 【Exquisite Gift & Unique Design】The christmas glitter lantern is a surprise gift for your family and kids. You can put it on the table, mantel or a bookshelf. The christmas lighted lantern decorated with sparkling sequins, the Santa Claus, christymas tree and splendid background, which creates a happy atmosphere at Christmas. 【Power Supply】The christmas lanterns decorative illuminated operated by 3AA batterries (NOT INCLUDE) and you can put it anywhere you like. You can also use the USB to DC cable (INCLUDED in the package) to charge. It's very convenient and easy to use. 【6 Hours Timer】The battery operated glitter globe comes with three modes of timed shutdown. When switching to ON1, the light will be on and music will play for 6 hours, when switching to ON2, the light will be on for 6 hours and then automatically turn off after music & lighting for 6 hours. 【Durable & Enjoy】 The christmas musical decorations is made of sturdy ABS plastic so that it can accompany you for a long time. The snowman lantern can relax your busy life and enjoy the joy of Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+Ao+W3sRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"On'h","source_asin":"B09C1S2WCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C1S2WCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C1S2WCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450270,"name":"Hasbro Gaming Candy Land Kingdom Of Sweet Adventures Board Game For Kids Ages 3 & Up (Amazon Exclusive), Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yUG40gv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description If you loved playing the Candy Land board game when you were a child, you can share the experience with your loved ones and start down the \"magical\" road to sweet surprises! This adorable version of the classic Candy Land game features gingerbread men as movers, colored cards, and fun illustrations that kids love, with different destinations like Cookie Commons and the chunky Chocolate Mountain. Players choose their cards, move their pawns, and let their imaginations soar as they make their way to the castle to win! For 2 to 4 players. Hasbro Gaming and all related terms are trademarks of Hasbro. Amazon.com \"Once upon a time, King Kandy, the Imperial Head Bonbon and Grand Jujube of Candy Land disappeared.\" Thus begins the magical journey of Milton Bradley's classic Candy Land board game. Captivated by the story of a kidnapped king and eager to help find him, little ones move their gingerbread pawns along a rainbow path and through a land of candy characters, all subjects of King Kandy's realm. Playing cards thoughtfully designed for non-readers are coded with colorful squares matching the jeweled stepping-stone path or an occasional token matching one of the characters' symbols: draw a blue card, move to the nearest blue stepping-stone; draw a snowflake and earn a visit to Queen Frostine's iceberg. There are occasional pitfalls, too: land on the wrong square and you might be stuck in Molasses Swamp until a red card is drawn. With all these enticing, sugarcoated images (and King Kandy plainly visible at path's end), children can't help but be delighted by Candy Land. It's delicious! Instructions are in both Spanish and English. Candy Land is for two to four players) --Julie Ubben From the Manufacturer Every child's first game, Candy Land is a colorful way for a preschooler to experience the joy of game play. The game teaches color recognition and matching while reinforcing the lesson of taking turns and being a gracious winner or loser. You will love to see the smile on a young person's face as they travel through Candy Land. Includes four gingerbread pawns, a gameboard, a card deck, and instructions in English and Spanish. Review For 2 to 4 players For 2 to 4 players Includes game board, game cards, and plastic playing pieces Includes game board, game cards, and plastic playing pieces No reading required to play No reading required to play Skills: color recognition Skills: color recognition Supply is limited -- Supply is limited -- See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yUG40gv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hasbro Gaming","source_asin":"B00000DMF5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00000DMF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00000DMF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
