window.products.push({"id":450278,"name":"A0CC0 Professional Color Chef Kitchen Knife Set 6 pieces, ultra-sharp high-carbon stainless steel blades and Nonstick coating, meet all kitchen needs,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpHrr6KeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a 6-piece kitchen knife set, 8-inch kitchen knife, 8-inch steak knife, 8-inch bread knife, 3-inch fruit knife and melon seed knife. Our knife set is made of multifunctional streamlined stainless steel and is a multifunctional kitchen scissors. It has excellent blade retention and is easy to maintain. They are dishwasher safe, but we recommend hand washing to maintain clarity and long-term use. Be careful when handling sharp objects. Avoid cutting hard surfaces such as stone, metal or glass. It is not recommended to use a knife, but a meat cleaver to cut bones, because other knives are easily damaged. Note: 1. Clean the knife before use. Avoid direct contact with the blade. 2. Please pay attention to sharp edges when using. Do not test with your fingers to avoid injury. 3. Clean and store in a safe place away from children. 4. In order to maintain the service life of the knife, it is recommended to clean the knife manually, use a detergent and dry it with a towel or paper towel. 5. To wipe dry, wipe the edge of the blade on the back of the knife. Store the knife in a safe place to protect the blade and avoid injury. 6. Use a sharpener or whetstone to sharpen the knife at an angle of 16 degrees, or sharpen the knife at home by a professional！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpHrr6KeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOCCO","source_asin":"B089WDSDVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089WDSDVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089WDSDVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450279,"name":"Eclipse Kendall Blackout Thermal Curtain Panel,Stone blue,84-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yP5Sy94iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the darkness, silence and beauty of Eclipse curtains. Eclipse blackout panels have been laboratory-tested to block out over 99% of intrusive light, unwanted noise and can help you save on home heating and cooling costs. Eclipse curtains offer a unique blend of fashion and function for any home decor. Transform your media room into the ultimate home theater experience, or create ambiance in your dining area. National Sleep Foundation studies show that reduced light and noise are optimal for a better night's sleep. Eclipse Curtains are perfect for the bedroom, kid's room or nursery, providing the ideal sleep environment for the whole family. The magic is in the Therma back construction. The innovative foam-backing is applied to the fabric and allows you to enjoy all of the light-blocking, noise reducing and energy saving benefits, while providing the same fashionable style and elegance of naturally flowing curtains. Hang two or more curtain panels on a standard or decorative rod for optimal coverage and desired effect. Sold as a single rod-pocket panel measuring 42\" wide in your choice of 63\", 84\", or 95\" lengths. Woven drapery offers a subtle texture is available in cafe beige, black, chocolate brown, ruby red, ivory, stone blue, artichoke green, raspberry pink, purple, denim navy blue, chili red, turquoise and lime green. Curtain rod sold separately. 100% Polyester. Machine wash gentle cycle, tumble dry, do not bleach. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yP5Sy94iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECLIPSE","source_asin":"B00DPWVI6A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DPWVI6A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DPWVI6A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
