window.products.push({"id":450319,"name":"AUJOY Recliner Chair Cover Stretch 1-Piece Couch Slipcover Jacquard Spandex Fabric Sofa Furniture Protector with Anti-Slip Foams and Straps (Recliner,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uTtE-36PL._AC_.jpg","description":"To the modern decor, the home is never finished: It's always a work in progress. We are constantly changing the way it looks, rearranging the furniture, bringing in new pieces, changing the colors of our recliners. Solid coloring makes AUJOY slipcovers easily blend with our current color palette. Top quality materials with soft, breathable and skin-friendly features make it deeply favored by the world. ☑ Pet Friendly Protection People with pets are well aware of the struggle to win the never-ending battle against fur buildup. And if you’re not careful, your recliner can quickly become a nest of unwanted fluff. This slipcover is a best pick for pet owners not only because it does a great job of protecting your recliner, but because it anchors foam rods to the seat to prevent slips caused by leaping cats and pups (or kids, for that matter). ☑Dust-proof Protection Our slipcover is totally dust-proof, we have taken use of the full-coverage cover for you, it will be a perfect protection from dirt, spills, food debris, footprints and Kids doodle. Great for those who are seeking the shields for furniture.Or if your recliner is too old, don’t need to buy a new one. Just take our cover, it can freshen your recliner up and give you a different visual effect. ☑High Stretch Differs from those cheap and common fabrics of others, this recliner cover is crafted from spandex blend fabric, which makes it applicable to most recliners. And the elastic loops through the recliner back to fit perfectly. Not easily deformed and more durable. If you have any confuses about how to install it after receiving or how to solve something during usage, you can contact with me directly, I will be happy to serve at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uTtE-36PL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUJOY","source_asin":"B07XQ4311H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XQ4311H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XQ4311H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450320,"name":"AcuRite Digital Wireless Fridge and Freezer Thermometer with Alarm and Max/Min Temperature for Home ,LCD Display, Restaurants (00986M), 0.6, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618MmGrxynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This dual-purpose freezer and fridge thermometer manages to be in two places at once. Using two wireless, remote thermometers, communicating with a door- or wall-mounted display, you will be able to be alerted when freezer or refrigerator temperatures are out of preferred range. This thermometer helps you store foods at safe temperatures to prevent food spoilage and avoid related foodborne illnesses. The wireless thermometers provide data to the digital thermometer display to show refrigerator and freezer temperatures and record highs and lows for each environment, as recorded by each remote thermometer. A programmable alarm notifies you audibly and visually when temperatures exceed your set minimum or maximum range. The digital thermometer display has an integrated magnet and keyhole for easy mounting. The digital display requires 2 AAA batteries, and each sensor requires 2 AA alkaline or lithium batteries (not included). Lithium batteries are recommended for use in sensors for temperatures below 4 degrees Fahrenheit (-20 degrees Celsius). By using this combination of temperature gauge and freezer monitor, you will rest assured that your family's food is stored safely and appropriately. This digital refrigerator and freezer thermometer Comes with a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618MmGrxynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AcuRite","source_asin":"B07YD4SM67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD4SM67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD4SM67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
