window.products.push({"id":450396,"name":"Personalized Imprinted Heavy Duty Quad Chair by Quik Shade - Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+nKuFP83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSTOMIZING INSTRUCTIONS Simply click \"Customize Now\" to begin personalizing your new chair! We offer one line of text included with the chair in your choice of many fonts and colors. In the Location of Inscription box, type in either Front or Back. Type in your inscription exactly as you want it on the chair, we will personalize it exactly as it is typed. If you would like to add an extra line, you MUST choose Yes from the dropdown box under \"Would you like an EXTRA line of text.\" Enter in all of your extra line information in the EXTRA LINE of text box. If you would like it on the same side as the INCLUDED line, choose \"Under the included line\" and we will center both lines on the same side. If you would like it on the opposite side, choose \"On other side of the chair\". If information is entered here and you have chosen NO in the \"Would you like an EXTRA line of text?\" box, all of the EXTRA LINE information will be ignored. HAPPY PERSONALIZING! IMPRINTING PROCESS DESCRIPTION -The heat imprint process is cut from vinyl and then applied to the fabric under high heat and pressure, fusing the vinyl into the fabric permanently creating a screen print like result. CHAIR DESCRIPTION: Our heavy duty portable chair is great for outdoor events, picnics, the beach and much more. This heavy duty chair comes in gray and black, and can support up to 500 lbs. in weight. It's strong steel frame is sturdy and durable, and it features a moisture resistant fabric with PE coating. Get comfortable seating anywhere with the Heavy Duty Chair from Quik Shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+nKuFP83L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everywhere Chair","source_asin":"B07Q4XFCWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q4XFCWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q4XFCWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450397,"name":"Fantasy Garden White Throw Blanket,Throw Blanket with Tassel for Couch, Sofa,Bed and Picnic,Decorative Cozy Travel Blanket Large Cream Throw Blanket (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BVBzld8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【VERSATILE】This soft throw blanket is suitable for many places.When you snuggle on the couch,sofa or bed,it can make you feel relax and cozy. When you are outdoors,the knit blanket can be used as a camping blanket or picnic blanket. 【SIZE & MATERIAL】The white throw blanket is made of cotton laced with polyester fibres,and has two colors and three sizes available.This soft blanket is prewashed and free of harmful chemicals. 【UNIQUE DESIGN】The extra large throw blanket is made with a unique weaving process, exquisite workmanship. The decorative tassels make it more distinctive. 【INTERIOR DECORATION】Dressing up the couch with solid blankets with woven patterns adds the furniture or living room neater and more attractive . It is also perfect as an interior white decor or mid century modern decor. 【WASHING CARE】Blankets & throws are washed with warm water, dry cleaning and machine washing are available, and if you are machine washing, choose the gentle mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BVBzld8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasy Garden","source_asin":"B09D7PKFZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7PKFZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7PKFZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450398,"name":"Cardboard Safari Recycled Cardboard Animal Taxidermy Deer Trophy Head, Bucky (Micro, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VMwHEOb4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Male deer, called bucks, are easily recognizable in the summer and fall by their prominent set of antlers, which are grown annually and fall off in the winter. Sparring is an activity bucks partake in to test one another for dominance. Sparring is also a reaffirmation of the status quo in each fraternal group and prevents actual fights from having to take place. Adult buck antlers start to grow around the last of March or early April, and grow at the rate of about a quarter-inch per day. Cardboard Safari: Based in the Blue Ridge mountains in Charlottesville, Virginia; inspired by the landscape that surrounds them. They celebrate the union of art and technology, joining imagination and fabrication to make beautiful sculptural forms for your home. Their goal is to make unique art; fun products that foster an appreciation for the natural world. Creativity, conservation, and collaboration are paramount to their mission. Warning: Cardboard is flammable, keep away from open flames and hot lights.  Cardboard edges are sharp, handle with care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VMwHEOb4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cardboard Safari","source_asin":"B071F19HZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071F19HZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071F19HZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
