window.products.push({"id":450647,"name":"Zulay Kitchen Bacon Grease Container With Strainer - 1L Stainless Steel Cooking Oil Container With Lid & Handle - Large Ghee Container or Bacon Fat Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SR-WSypvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAVE THE GREASE, ADD THE FLAVOR: From cooking eggs to sautéing vegetables, bacon grease can be used to add that extra sizzle in every meal. Our 1 liter bacon grease container will help you store the smokey flavor effortlessly. It is also perfect for straining and storing the excess oil from fried food to help reduce oil consumption. EFFICIENT AND FUNCTIONAL: This container comes with a mesh strainer to filter out all the bits and pieces for you. The curved handle offers a firm grip and lets you easily pour the oil. Store that precious bacon oil away by putting the lid back on; it offers a snug fit even with the grease strainer on to keep the dust out. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: This ghee container is made with food-grade stainless steel, making it rust-resistant and durable enough to use for storing bacony goodness for years to come. It also makes a great option for filtering coffee grounds. For anyone who loves bacon, this grease container makes a perfect gift. EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: After frying some deliciousness with every drop of bacon grease, this kitchen grease container can be hand washed or tossed in the dishwasher to get rid of the oil stains. Keep this bacon grease keeper right next to your stove or in your refrigerator without it taking up a lot of space. HASSLE FREE, ZULAY GUARANTEE: We love and take pride in our ghee container and back this up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are ever any issues, just contact us, and we will make it right (even after the Amazon return window is closed). Savor the flavor of bacon fat with this oil container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SR-WSypvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B09QMW9HDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMW9HDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMW9HDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
