window.products.push({"id":450777,"name":"CorVex Stock Pot with Lid, Large, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fKCERwF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CORVEX 5 Qt. Die-Cast Aluminum Pot Description Our Cookware uses our patented Corvex technology to distribute the heat evenly throughout the base of the pot, this even heat distribution allows you to cook up to 33% faster, saving time, energy, and money. Corvex is a 4 in 1 pan. It has the high heat searing power of stainless steel, heat retention like cast iron, heats with distribution and durability like ceramic and it's easy to clean just like a nonstick pan. None other than Celebrity Chef Anne Burrell of Food Network fame, has been using the cookware for well over a year and has signed on to be our brand spokesperson. What are PFOA and PFTE? PFTE(Polytetrafluoroethylene) & PFOA(Perfluorooctanoic acid) are synthetic chemicals used in the manufacture of the coatings of almost all non-stick pans in the market. Some of these pans retain little or no trace of this chemical, even though exposure took place at some point of the production Though not toxic at low levels, what's better than actually using a pan that doesn't utilize these chemicals at some point of the production? Not only is CorVex absolutely PFOA and PTFE-free, its a revolutionary product given the diverse functionality Key Features • CorVex vortex gently moves superheated air from the middle to the edge, cooking food 30% faster • Ergonomic Soft Touch Handle : Handles stays cool always • 4-in-1 functionality • Cast aluminum construction: makes surface virtually scratch resistant","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fKCERwF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CorVex","source_asin":"B013TEPG5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013TEPG5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013TEPG5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450778,"name":"Easter Decoration Lights - Led String Lights, Lights for Easter Holiday Party Home Yard Indoor Outdoor Decor - 100 Led Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LUttVa-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Decorations For Your Home Whether it's Christmas decoration, ordinary home decoration, Thanksgiving decoration, or even wedding decoration, it can perfectly meet all your needs. Just Enjoy Your Thanksgiving Dinner Very cute for fall decorations. Use it in your dinning table,trust me,it will warm your dinner time. Best Holiday Gift for Families and Friends Who don't want a maple light string to decorate his/her house or living room? Let's send some Thanksgiving atmosphere to those important people. Decorate Any Corner of Your House Whether it's day or night, indoor or outdoor, the maple leaf light will relaxes you physically and mentally. Premium Light Beads The orange and yellow leaves lit by the vibrant orange lights make for a great blend of colors to warm up any room. Perfect festival decorations for Thanksgiving day and safe with no outlet needed. Artificial Maple Leaves This artificial maple leaf is made of PVC material, it is waterproof, durable and looks more like the real fallen leaves. How to use: Just put 3 AA batteries(not included in the package) inside and turn it on! Has two options, solid light or blinking. Where to use: Table top, mantel, fireplace, doorframe, doorway, stair banisters, windows , railings etc. Just open your imagination. Place it anywhere you like. PRECAUTIONS Warm Tips: Batteries are Replaceable.LED lights and Maple leaves are waterproof, but the battery box isn't. For safety reasons, please use alkaline batteries or rechargeable batteries. If you are not satisfied with this maple leaves String lights, we will offer you an exchange or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LUttVa-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dritrip","source_asin":"B08K3CZDW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K3CZDW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K3CZDW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":450779,"name":"Air Cooler-HiFresh Evaporative Cooling Fan&Bladeless Tower Fan w/Remote, 3 Wind Speeds&Cool Mode, Humidification/Cooling w/Ice Packs, 80°Ooscillation,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616r5PrY75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 in 1 Evaporative Air Cooler, Real Game Changer in Summer】HiFresh evaporative air cooler can be used as fan, humidifier or air cooler (not traditional AC). With 4 modes (natural, sleep, cool, super) and 3 speeds (low, medium and high) to personalize the heat dissipation effect, 12 combinations will redefine your summer cooling method. Whether it's the icy cold you can experience on a snowy mountain or the breeze by the lake, HiFresh meets all your cooling needs! 【80° Widespread Oscillation & Remote Control】Compared with many other tower fans those only have 60-degree horizontal oscillation, HiFresh air cooler can provide 80° widespread oscillation, not only horizontally but vertically. It distributes cooling air around your space evenly and more efficiently. Plus, just a click to control your fan from 20ft, making it possible that watch the latest series of TV or read on the sofa without moving half a foot! 【Save your Wallet, Save the Earth】Traditional air conditioners use compressors and refrigerants, which will increase electricity bills and the burden on the earth. HiFresh Evaporative cooler uses only water, a fan motor, and a pump to cool or humidify your space but only costs pennies. Its eco-friendly cooling method does not utilize anyl chemicals or refrigerants, and it can also save you a lot of electricity bills. Choose green and eco life, come with HiFresh to give our mother earth a break! 【Removable & Portable Design】Equipped with 4 heavy-duty wheels(2 lockings and 2 non-lockings) that are 360-degree rotated, you can make the air cooler easy to roll into the place you need. Besides, a hidden-handle on the top that you can easily lift the fan. With these two compact designs that you can conveniently remove the air cooler in conditions like a living room, bedroom, patios, garages, warehouses, and more. Enjoy the fast coolness where you do not have a central AC. 【Exclusive Smart Sleep Mode】In addition to the mute of less than 45 dB, HiFresh also designed a unique intelligent sleep mode. The wind speed will change over time. It will cool down quickly when you sleep lightly. After you enter deep sleep, the machine will enter a breeze to take care of your sleep. Ideal for children or the elderly at home, HiFresh will keep you comfortable all night without worrying about inflammation and dryness of your skin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616r5PrY75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIFRESH","source_asin":"B0925RSCSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0925RSCSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0925RSCSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
