window.products.push({"id":450942,"name":"360 S8 Plus Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo, Botslab Self-Empty LIDAR Navigation Smart Mapping Robot, 2700Pa Suction, Carpet Detection, Work with Alexa, WI","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ShT3+T2BL._AC_SL1428_.jpg","description":"【Intelligent Self-emptying Station】This smart robot vacuum can clean the house automatically and return to the base after work, then the base will clean the dustbin and collect everything to the 4L big dust bag, all you have to do is changing the dust bag 5 times a year, really hands-free robot. 【Precision LiDAR Navigation】3D mapping technology enabled the S8 Plus robot accurately map the whole house and plan an optimal route in real-time. Anti-collision sensors intelligently detect and avoid obstacles so you can be confident of a thorough and careful cleaning, even in complex scenarios. 【Superior Suction Power】Provided by the brushless motor, the S8 Plus can easily draw out pet hair and dirt with a superior suction up to 2700Pa, and auto-boost suction to powerful mode on detected carpets and rugs, easily pick up even invisible dust hidden deep inside. 【2-In-1 Vacuum & Mop】S8 Plus saves time and effort by offering effective one-step vacuuming and mopping cleaning, strong suction power quickly clean up pet hair, dirt and debris. Automatically controls water output with additional pressure, the S8 Plus achieves deep stain removal and instant dry-up. 【Long Running Time and Self Recharging】This long-lasting robot vacuum comes with a 5000 mAh high-capacity battery, it allows the S8 Plus to run up to 3 hours, enough for a long time whole room cleaning. It will return to the charging base for recharging when it's in a low battery state. 【Smart APP and Alexa Voice Control】Botslab App allows you to control the robot anytime, anywhere. You can customize maps, schedule cleaning for different rooms or specified zones, find a real-time display of consumables status, set up no-go zones. 2.4GHz WiFi only. Supporting voice control like Alexa, Google Assistant, etc. 360 Smart Life provides 12-month warranty, please feel free to talk to our customer support team for more efficient communication.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ShT3+T2BL._AC_SL1428_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"+ 360","source_asin":"B0B7J8DY6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-450942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7J8DY6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7J8DY6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
